{"version":1,"content":"<p>法國公開指責伊朗對近期發生的一系列網絡攻擊負責。這些攻擊導致全法數百家超市的冷藏設備癱瘓，引發混亂。「這次攻擊的責任在於伊朗伊斯蘭革命衞隊，」法國外交部長Jean-Noel Barrot周一在巴黎表示。法國直接將網絡攻擊歸咎於外國勢力的情況並不多見。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585664.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.342199+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T19:51:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"f6f93a86cb30ec230e7777db5c781f40ca5cd1090936f16e441785fd997d1eb8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}